Z||000000||DreXteR||01-14-2001||02:23 PM||||Yes is me again....   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>The Z34 engine will fit into the fiero?  This an interesting swap, this baby makes 210hp insted the 160hp from the camaro engine. If it fit, the compression is 9.2 can it be lowered down to 8.5 or so? This is for a turbo setup.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><P>And why is a big gap in HP betwin Camaro engine an Z34?  20hp is comprensible but 50hp!  <P>Thax guys.<BR>DreXteR||||reg||5
